  "help": {
    "aboutF2C": "🌿 About F2C",
    "aboutDesc": "✅ F2C (Farm to Consumer) - directly from farmers to you.\n\n✅ 100% Fresh - Direct from local farms\n🌾 Harvest Calendar - Weekly harvesting calendar\n💵 Fair Price - No middlemen, better rates\n⏱ Freshness Tracker - Real-time hours since harvest\n👨‍👩‍👧 Group Buy - Group shopping discounts\n📅 Pre-Order - Reserve crop harvests early\n🥗 Nutrition Report - Weekly health report card\n🗺️ Farm Visit - Experience farming in-person\n💬 Farmer Chat - Direct text chat with grower\n📷 QR Verification - Verify farmer audit data\n🌍 3 Languages - Tamil, English, Malayalam\n✅ 100% Natural & Organic options\n\nVersion 1.0.0 | Made with ❤️ for Tamil Nadu Farmers",
    "faqTitle": "Frequently Asked Questions",
    "faq1q": "What is F2C App?",
    "faq1a": "F2C stands for 'Farm to Consumer'. It connects you directly with local farmers to buy fresh produce. No middlemen means fair prices for you and better profits for farmers!",
    "faq2q": "How do I order products?",
    "faq2a": "Choose items from the home screen, add them to your cart, go to checkout, enter your delivery address, and place the order.",
    "faq3q": "How long does delivery take?",
    "faq3a": "Typically within 24 hours. Specific delivery schedules for each item are displayed on its details page.",
    "faq4q": "What is Pre-Ordering?",
    "faq4a": "It allows you to reserve crops before they are harvested. You get the freshest produce harvested on day one and enjoy a 15-28% discount!",
    "faq5q": "What is Group Buy?",
    "faq5a": "Group Buy lets you pool orders with 5 or more neighbors/friends to a single location. You get 15-25% discounts and free delivery.",
    "faq6q": "How do I make payments?",
    "faq6a": "Currently, Cash on Delivery (COD) is available. Online payment options (UPI, cards) will be introduced soon.",
    "faq7q": "What does 'Verified Farmer' mean?",
    "faq7a": "The F2C team physically visits and audits farms. Audited farmers get a 'Verified' badge, which you can verify by scanning their QR code.",
    "faq8q": "How can I return items or get a refund?",
    "faq8a": "If you are not satisfied with quality, contact customer support within 24 hours of delivery. We will issue a full refund!",
    "faq9q": "What is the Harvest Calendar?",
    "faq9a": "It shows upcoming harvest dates added by farmers. You can see when specific crops will be harvested and pre-order them in advance.",
    "faq10q": "How does the Freshness Tracker work?",
    "faq10a": "It calculates and displays the exact time elapsed since the farmer harvested the crop, showing you exactly how fresh the produce is.",
    "faq11q": "What is the Nutrition Report?",
    "faq11a": "A weekly report analyzing your orders to show the nutritional value (vitamins, minerals) of your food, helping you maintain a balanced diet.",
    "faq12q": "How do I chat with a farmer directly?",
    "faq12a": "Click the 'Chat' icon on the product page or farmer profile. You can ask about farming methods, organic certifications, or delivery details.",
    "faq13q": "What are Reels & Stories?",
    "faq13a": "Short videos uploaded by farmers showing their fields, crop growth, and harvesting. You can see exactly how and where your food is grown!",
    "faq14q": "What is a Farm Visit?",
    "faq14a": "A booking option to visit the farms with your family, interact with farmers, see agricultural practices firsthand, and experience nature.",
    "contact": "Contact Us",
    "contactNote": "If you face any issues, please contact us:",
